  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Pumpin 4 the Man** (1 review): Captain Fantasy is missing from the files; it would have followed this song in the proper order [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Don't get too Close**: back after 40 archived shows (966 days) [3]\n- **Pumpin 4 the Man**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Buenos Tardes Amigos**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Puffy Cloud (only one verse), El Camino**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **some keyboard sounds**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Dancing in the Show Tonight, Wavin My Dick In The Wind [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1997-09-28** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 139 min [1]. Said about its sound: Recording is not great sounding but listenable, and the performance itself is excellent [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1997-09-28**: Reviewer guesses the source was burned to CD with disc 2 tracks accidentally sorted in reverse order [2]",
